      919     define buffer buf_temp-trndocrs-pl-gds-rsrv  for temp-trndocrs-pl-gds-rsrv .
      920     do
      921     on error undo, return error return-value
      922     :
      923       for each buf_temp-trndocrs-pl-gds-rsrv
      924       on error undo, return error return-value
      925       :
      926         delete buf_temp-trndocrs-pl-gds-rsrv .
